      "writtenOn": "2023-01-14T10:55:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "ok, I think what we need here is a new KeepaliveInfo as a normal caller, then the flow will work the same as it is. No particular member of original design is reset now(The idea is similar here but I think it should be easily to understand(I hope)).\n\nDoes new patchset address the comment?",
      "parentUuid": "276e6af2_831e5eb8",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 453,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 459,
        "endChar": 62
      },
